{
  "work_id": "titus-khanmeti-gospels/john",
  "source_path": "titus-khanmeti-gospels/john.json",
  "source_language": "oge",
  "target_language": "eng",
  "provenance": {
    "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-04": {
      "model": "claude-opus-5-5",
      "prompt_version": "bulk-2026-10-12",
      "date": "2026-11-04",
      "script": "__main__"
    }
  },
  "translations": [
    {
      "chunk_id": "titus-khanmeti-gospels/john#John.1.31",
      "source_sha256": "df76adf6abfa99a9",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-04",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "to baptize with water."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "titus-khanmeti-gospels/john#John.1.32",
      "source_sha256": "0543042eab68b9e2",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-04",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "And John bore witness and said: For I saw the Spirit of God like a dove coming down from heaven and resting"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "titus-khanmeti-gospels/john#John.1.33",
      "source_sha256": "2331674ff0a3ba48",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-04",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "upon him. I did not know him, but he who sent me to baptize with water said to me: The one upon whom you see the Spirit coming down and resting, he is the one who baptizes with the Holy"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "titus-khanmeti-gospels/john#John.1.34",
      "source_sha256": "d75f7f82564fea12",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-04",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Spirit. I have seen and borne witness that this is the Son of God."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "titus-khanmeti-gospels/john#John.1.35",
      "source_sha256": "5b5629bb8a8713de",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-04",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "On the next day John was standing there, and two of his disciples."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "titus-khanmeti-gospels/john#John.1.36",
      "source_sha256": "dfa510b5197fa9ad",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-04",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "And he looked at Jesus as he was walking, and said: Behold, Christ, the Lamb"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "titus-khanmeti-gospels/john#John.1.37",
      "source_sha256": "f410d80ab3818e43",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-04",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "of God. And the two disciples heard him [?] this, and they followed"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "titus-khanmeti-gospels/john#John.1.38",
      "source_sha256": "dc23666b2f834ee2",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-04",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Jesus. Jesus turned and saw them following him."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "titus-khanmeti-gospels/john#John.1.39",
      "source_sha256": "14ed1880344fdaee",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-04",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "And he said to them: Come and see. And they went and saw where he was staying."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "titus-khanmeti-gospels/john#John.2.22",
      "source_sha256": "8456e4cb74bceba9",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-04",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "his disciples, that he had said this; and they believed the scripture and the word which"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "titus-khanmeti-gospels/john#John.2.23",
      "source_sha256": "6224cccbc1a5a131",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-04",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Jesus had spoken to them. And when he was in Jerusalem at the Passover [?] feast, many believed in his name, for they saw the sign that he was doing."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "titus-khanmeti-gospels/john#John.2.24",
      "source_sha256": "12411d218b7d4558",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-04",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "But Jesus himself did not entrust himself to them, for he knew everyone,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "titus-khanmeti-gospels/john#John.2.25",
      "source_sha256": "d4a65b0aa47676ea",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-04",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "for he did not [?] that anyone should bear witness about man, for he himself knew what was in man."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "titus-khanmeti-gospels/john#John.3.1",
      "source_sha256": "d2678dac6f239a9c",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-04",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "There was a certain man of the Pharisees, named Nicodemus, a ruler of the Jews."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "titus-khanmeti-gospels/john#John.3.2",
      "source_sha256": "793b0e47f04ed04d",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-04",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "He came to him by night and said to him: Rabbi, I know that you have been sent from God as a teacher, for no one is able to do these signs that you do unless God is [?]."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "titus-khanmeti-gospels/john#John.3.8",
      "source_sha256": "0469cf4a350c533b",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-04",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "comes and where it goes. So it is with everyone who is born of the Spirit."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "titus-khanmeti-gospels/john#John.3.9",
      "source_sha256": "84fd84277bac3d99",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-04",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Nicodemus answered and said to him: How can this be?"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "titus-khanmeti-gospels/john#John.3.10",
      "source_sha256": "37afe0f1f7afec16",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-04",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Jesus said to him: You are the teacher of Israel, and you do not know this?"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "titus-khanmeti-gospels/john#John.3.11",
      "source_sha256": "f5dc30f0e08df70a",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-04",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Amen, amen, I say to you: we speak what we know, and we bear witness to what we have seen, and you do not accept our testimony."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "titus-khanmeti-gospels/john#John.3.12",
      "source_sha256": "81a5e6657dccb2cd",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-04",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "If I have told you earthly things and you do not believe, how will you believe if I tell you heavenly things?"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "titus-khanmeti-gospels/john#John.3.13",
      "source_sha256": "99b745dd7516e9a0",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-04",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "And no one has gone up into heaven except the one who came down from heaven, the Son of Man."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "titus-khanmeti-gospels/john#John.3.14",
      "source_sha256": "61abb6e6c0856845",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-04",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "And just as Moses lifted up the serpent in the wilderness, so must the Son"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "titus-khanmeti-gospels/john#John.3.15",
      "source_sha256": "93e3fbe188766e96",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-04",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "of Man be lifted up, so that whoever believes in him may have eternal life."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "titus-khanmeti-gospels/john#John.3.16",
      "source_sha256": "74b1c5269c30cced",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-04",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "For God so loved the world that the Son also"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "titus-khanmeti-gospels/john#John.4.43",
      "source_sha256": "f0ae12f020e4e721",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-04",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "And after those two days he went out from there to Galilee."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "titus-khanmeti-gospels/john#John.4.44",
      "source_sha256": "bae9c9544c3eacf9",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-04",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "For Jesus himself testified that a prophet has no honour in his own country."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "titus-khanmeti-gospels/john#John.4.45",
      "source_sha256": "cf0cb04ce2a53e4d",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-04",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "And when he came to Galilee, the Galileans received him, for they had seen everything he had done in Jerusalem at the feast."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "titus-khanmeti-gospels/john#John.4.46",
      "source_sha256": "4a4ffc5eae40b1d4",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-04",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Jesus came again to Cana of Galilee, where he had made the water wine. And there was a certain royal official whose son was sick at Capernaum."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "titus-khanmeti-gospels/john#John.4.47",
      "source_sha256": "9537da54b970c360",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-04",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "This man heard that Jesus had come from Judea to Galilee. He came to him and begged him to come and heal his son [?] he was near to death."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "titus-khanmeti-gospels/john#John.4.48",
      "source_sha256": "41dafbbd19c45025",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-04",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Jesus said to him: Unless you see [?]"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "titus-khanmeti-gospels/john#John.5.2",
      "source_sha256": "e9ef16b44f31ea48",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-04",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "And in Jerusalem, at the Sheep Pool, there is a pool which is called in Hebrew Bethesda, with five porticoes."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "titus-khanmeti-gospels/john#John.5.3",
      "source_sha256": "11cd320b3799110d",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-04",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "In these lay a multitude of sick people: blind, lame and withered, who were waiting for the water."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "titus-khanmeti-gospels/john#John.5.6",
      "source_sha256": "d0010d9448b141ff",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-04",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "He said to him: Do you want to be healed?"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "titus-khanmeti-gospels/john#John.5.7",
      "source_sha256": "65cbb0646ff7afd4",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-04",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "The sick man answered and said to him: Lord, [?] no man to put me into this pool when this water is stirred up; while I am coming, another goes down before me."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "titus-khanmeti-gospels/john#John.6.14",
      "source_sha256": "a338fad1ec258ac5",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-04",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "[?] truly the prophet who has come into the world."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "titus-khanmeti-gospels/john#John.6.15",
      "source_sha256": "f232ecedd6089777",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-04",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "But Jesus perceived that they were coming to seize him in order to make him king; he withdrew and went away alone."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "titus-khanmeti-gospels/john#John.6.16",
      "source_sha256": "80c70a193589566f",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-04",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "And when evening came, his disciples went down to the sea."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "titus-khanmeti-gospels/john#John.6.17",
      "source_sha256": "7322dc3536afd4f8",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-04",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "And they got into a boat and were going across the sea to Capernaum. It was already growing dark, and Jesus had not yet come to them."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "titus-khanmeti-gospels/john#John.6.18",
      "source_sha256": "ac809148a186ae6b",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-04",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "And the sea was being stirred up by a wind."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "titus-khanmeti-gospels/john#John.6.19",
      "source_sha256": "454e354ad75c5a1c",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-04",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "And when they had gone about twenty-five or thirty stadia, they saw Jesus walking on the sea, and when he came near their boat, they were afraid."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "titus-khanmeti-gospels/john#John.6.20",
      "source_sha256": "0f76b7ac9fb1370e",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-04",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "But he said to them: It is I; do not be afraid."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "titus-khanmeti-gospels/john#John.6.21",
      "source_sha256": "34e5ad88c2ca82b6",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-04",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "And they wanted to take him into the boat, and immediately it was found [?]"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "titus-khanmeti-gospels/john#John.6.32",
      "source_sha256": "4c66dd38c56a8a4b",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-04",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "But my Father has given you the true bread from heaven."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "titus-khanmeti-gospels/john#John.6.33",
      "source_sha256": "164f20c69e9b614b",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-04",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "For the bread of God is that which came down from heaven and gave life to the world."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "titus-khanmeti-gospels/john#John.6.34",
      "source_sha256": "e96e31f4c7cc376b",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-04",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "They said to him: Lord, give us this bread always."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "titus-khanmeti-gospels/john#John.6.35",
      "source_sha256": "cf4519f52ad466d9",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-04",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Jesus said to them: I am the bread of life. Whoever comes to me will not hunger, and whoever believes in me will never thirst."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "titus-khanmeti-gospels/john#John.6.36",
      "source_sha256": "239afd64a44f2489",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-04",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "But I said to you that you have seen me, and"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "titus-khanmeti-gospels/john#John.6.37",
      "source_sha256": "488c3149d4113b5f",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-04",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "you do not believe. All that my Father gives me will come to me, and whoever comes to me I will not cast out."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "titus-khanmeti-gospels/john#John.6.38",
      "source_sha256": "5fefff31c4493a7c",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-04",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "For I came down from heaven not to do my own will, but the will of [?] me."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "titus-khanmeti-gospels/john#John.6.39",
      "source_sha256": "97d582e4a68445aa",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-04",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "For this is the will of the Father who sent me: that of all that the Father has given me I should lose none, but should raise it up on the last day."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "titus-khanmeti-gospels/john#John.6.64",
      "source_sha256": "19ca237d667ab29e",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-04",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "…of you who do not believe. For Jesus knew from the beginning who they were who did not believe, and who it was who would betray him."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "titus-khanmeti-gospels/john#John.6.65",
      "source_sha256": "81ed991169eccb9e",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-04",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "And he said: \"For this reason I said to you that no one is able to come to me unless it has been given to him by the Father"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "titus-khanmeti-gospels/john#John.6.66",
      "source_sha256": "5a6dba84c5db2d04",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-04",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "of mine.\" Because of this many of his disciples turned back and no longer walked with him."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "titus-khanmeti-gospels/john#John.6.67",
      "source_sha256": "6c0a04f8b3cbd94c",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-04",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Jesus said to the Twelve: \"Do you also perhaps wish to go away?\""
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "titus-khanmeti-gospels/john#John.6.68",
      "source_sha256": "c18dca3e2e12b2df",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-04",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Simon Peter answered and said to him: \"Lord, to whom shall we go? The words of eternal life"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "titus-khanmeti-gospels/john#John.6.69",
      "source_sha256": "b2b10ce7bc03af31",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-04",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "you have, and we have believed and have come to know that you are the Christ, the Son of God.\""
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "titus-khanmeti-gospels/john#John.6.70",
      "source_sha256": "ad7939f17c762344",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-04",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Jesus answered and said to them: \"Did I not choose you, the Twelve? And one of you"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "titus-khanmeti-gospels/john#John.6.71",
      "source_sha256": "7905ac91b41701bd",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-04",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "is a devil.\" Now he was speaking of Judas, son of Simon."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "titus-khanmeti-gospels/john#John.7.22",
      "source_sha256": "012b7310df6dc4ed",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-04",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "…you marvel. For this reason Moses gave you circumcision (not that it is from Moses, but from the fathers), and you circumcise on the Sabbath."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "titus-khanmeti-gospels/john#John.7.23",
      "source_sha256": "3584f0c9b0bc8a3f",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-04",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "If a man receives circumcision on the Sabbath so that the Law of Moses may not be broken, do you blame me because I made a man entirely well on the Sabbath?"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "titus-khanmeti-gospels/john#John.7.24",
      "source_sha256": "0787d15ed0e5a5a6",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-04",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Do not judge by appearances, but judge with righteous judgment."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "titus-khanmeti-gospels/john#John.7.25",
      "source_sha256": "2d2624925d3b32e2",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-04",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Some of the people of Jerusalem were saying: \"Is this not the one whom they are seeking to kill?"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "titus-khanmeti-gospels/john#John.7.26",
      "source_sha256": "57da31c67e647420",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-04",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "And look, he speaks openly, and [?] nothing [?]. Can it be that the rulers truly [?] that this is the Christ?"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "titus-khanmeti-gospels/john#John.7.27",
      "source_sha256": "468a046affe1be0d",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-04",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "But we know where this man is from; yet when the Christ comes, no one will know where he is from.\""
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "titus-khanmeti-gospels/john#John.7.28",
      "source_sha256": "66149b409950a1e7",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-04",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Jesus cried out in the temple as he was teaching"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "titus-khanmeti-gospels/john#John.8.48",
      "source_sha256": "10d2cdd6c685e26c",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-04",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "And they said to him: \"Did we not say rightly that you are a Samaritan and have a demon?\""
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "titus-khanmeti-gospels/john#John.8.49",
      "source_sha256": "c31fcec37d6987c4",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-04",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Jesus answered and said to them: \"I do not have a demon; rather, I honor my Father, and [?]"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "titus-khanmeti-gospels/john#John.8.50",
      "source_sha256": "0c6b8a034075e4e8",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-04",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "But I do not seek my own glory; there is one who seeks it and judges."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "titus-khanmeti-gospels/john#John.8.51",
      "source_sha256": "b5725a2596ab9e24",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-04",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Amen, amen, I say to you: if anyone keeps my word, he will never see death.\""
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "titus-khanmeti-gospels/john#John.8.52",
      "source_sha256": "35a30ba1bb32a200",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-04",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "The Jews said to him: \"Now we know that you have a demon. Abraham died, and the prophets perished, [?] 'If anyone keeps my word, he will never taste death.'"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "titus-khanmeti-gospels/john#John.8.53",
      "source_sha256": "45a643525f762283",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-04",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Are you perhaps greater than our father"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "titus-khanmeti-gospels/john#John.13.34",
      "source_sha256": "994addcbbc3978f9",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-04",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "…you too should love"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "titus-khanmeti-gospels/john#John.13.35",
      "source_sha256": "a3769b07164b3d27",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-04",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "one another. By this everyone will know that you are my disciples: if you love one another.\""
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "titus-khanmeti-gospels/john#John.13.36",
      "source_sha256": "8dad68566d2fb745",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-04",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Simon Peter said to him"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "titus-khanmeti-gospels/john#John.13.38",
      "source_sha256": "7e0dd0a4247ecde0",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-04",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "…the cock will crow until you have denied me three times."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "titus-khanmeti-gospels/john#John.14.1",
      "source_sha256": "f6f2834a3566c925",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-04",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Do not let your heart be troubled. Believe in God, and believe in me."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "titus-khanmeti-gospels/john#John.15.15",
      "source_sha256": "4af8c50fc7afe434",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-04",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "[?] servants, for the servant does not know what his lord is doing. But I have called you friends, for everything that I heard from my Father I have made known to you."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "titus-khanmeti-gospels/john#John.15.16",
      "source_sha256": "b504b06bec839dc4",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-04",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "You did not choose me, but I chose you and appointed you, so that you"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "titus-khanmeti-gospels/john#John.15.17",
      "source_sha256": "0ea8cdd73af2910a",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-04",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "that you love one another."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "titus-khanmeti-gospels/john#John.15.18",
      "source_sha256": "9115ad26a414126c",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-04",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "If the world hates you, know that it hated me first."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "titus-khanmeti-gospels/john#John.15.19",
      "source_sha256": "22dbef2fe04db092",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-04",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "If you were of the world, the world would love its own; for not"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "titus-khanmeti-gospels/john#John.16.7",
      "source_sha256": "25dc05abe0c59ca4",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-04",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "I tell you the truth: it is better for you that I [?] go away, [?] the Comforter will not come to you. If I go away, I will send him"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "titus-khanmeti-gospels/john#John.16.8",
      "source_sha256": "da64279cd11de689",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-04",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "[to] you. He will come and will convict the world concerning sin and righteousness and judgment:"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "titus-khanmeti-gospels/john#John.16.9",
      "source_sha256": "f3d52d6d234d24d9",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-04",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "concerning sin, in this way: because they did not believe in me;"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "titus-khanmeti-gospels/john#John.16.10",
      "source_sha256": "ced01bf56c8e6fab",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-04",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "and concerning righteousness, because I am going to my Father and you will no longer see me;"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "titus-khanmeti-gospels/john#John.16.11",
      "source_sha256": "78012cd5a52e3802",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-04",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "and concerning judgment, because the ruler of this world has been judged."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "titus-khanmeti-gospels/john#John.16.12",
      "source_sha256": "c2395015fe62f403",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-04",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "I still have much to say [?] able to bear now."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "titus-khanmeti-gospels/john#John.16.13",
      "source_sha256": "76752bbdb2e38fa2",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-04",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "But when that Spirit of truth comes, he will guide you into all truth, for he will not speak on his own, but whatever he hears he will speak, and he will tell you what is to come."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "titus-khanmeti-gospels/john#John.16.14",
      "source_sha256": "bedcde7438393d7f",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-04",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "He will glorify me, for he will take from what is mine and tell it to you."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "titus-khanmeti-gospels/john#John.16.15",
      "source_sha256": "8980ed7d504c54ee",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-04",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Everything that the Father has is mine, and that is why I said to you"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "titus-khanmeti-gospels/john#John.16.16",
      "source_sha256": "0fae5cbb0590ae3f",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-04",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "A little while, and you will no longer see me; and again a little while, and you will see me."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "titus-khanmeti-gospels/john#John.16.17",
      "source_sha256": "dd81ca321abc3b0c",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-04",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "His disciples said [?] is this that he is telling us: 'A little while, and you will no longer see me; and again a little while, and you will see me,' and 'I am going to my Father'?"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "titus-khanmeti-gospels/john#John.16.18",
      "source_sha256": "e9fa731b5e496180",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-04",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "They were saying, \"What is this 'little while'? We do not know what he is saying.\""
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "titus-khanmeti-gospels/john#John.16.19",
      "source_sha256": "c6da205d23488e4a",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-04",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Jesus understood that they wanted to ask him, and he said to them, \"Are you asking one another about this, that I said, 'A little while, and you will no longer see me; and again a little while, and you will see me'?"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "titus-khanmeti-gospels/john#John.16.20",
      "source_sha256": "87ca08777e4e7877",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-04",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Amen, amen, I say to you that you will weep and"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "titus-khanmeti-gospels/john#John.17.5",
      "source_sha256": "33f50692f681b66e",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-04",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "And now glorify me, Father, with yourself, with the glory that I had with you before my being in the world."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "titus-khanmeti-gospels/john#John.17.6",
      "source_sha256": "67370ae0d6735b95",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-04",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "[?] this. I have made your name known to the people whom you gave me out of this world. They were yours, and you gave them to me, and they have kept your word."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "titus-khanmeti-gospels/john#John.17.7",
      "source_sha256": "f00941e0b6dac162",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-04",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "Now they have come to know that everything you gave me is from you,"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "titus-khanmeti-gospels/john#John.17.8",
      "source_sha256": "da40e4fb810e89e8",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-04",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "for the words [?] that you gave me I have given to them, and they received them and knew truly that I came from you, and they believed [?] you sent me."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "titus-khanmeti-gospels/john#John.17.9",
      "source_sha256": "b83e1afaa9e84c8c",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-04",
      "group_size": 25,
      "text": "I pray for them. I am not asking for the world but for those whom you gave me, for they are yours."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "titus-khanmeti-gospels/john#John.17.10",
      "source_sha256": "c7ac867ab57c7de7",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-04",
      "group_size": 18,
      "text": "And all that is yours is mine, and what is mine is yours, and I am glorified"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "titus-khanmeti-gospels/john#John.17.11",
      "source_sha256": "45f2e07b96039ee4",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-04",
      "group_size": 18,
      "text": "in them. And I am no longer in this world, but these are in the world"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "titus-khanmeti-gospels/john#John.19.11",
      "source_sha256": "906234dc7bbe4337",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-04",
      "group_size": 18,
      "text": "Jesus said to him: You would have no power over me at all, unless it had been given to you from above. Therefore the one who handed me over to you has the greater sin."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "titus-khanmeti-gospels/john#John.19.12",
      "source_sha256": "b2b8ebb5ca7d25b4",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-04",
      "group_size": 18,
      "text": "Because of this Pilate wanted [?] him; but the Jews cried out and said: If you release this man, you are not a friend of Caesar, for everyone who calls himself king speaks against Caesar."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "titus-khanmeti-gospels/john#John.19.13",
      "source_sha256": "e44d0f78ee5d3eb4",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-04",
      "group_size": 18,
      "text": "When Pilate heard these words, he brought Jesus outside, and he sat down on the judgment seat at the place called the Pavement, and in Hebrew Gabbatha."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "titus-khanmeti-gospels/john#John.19.14",
      "source_sha256": "90945f1d1344ea35",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-04",
      "group_size": 18,
      "text": "It was the Friday of the Passover [?] it was the sixth hour, and he said to the Jews: Here is your king."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "titus-khanmeti-gospels/john#John.19.15",
      "source_sha256": "40edf2e6458ae0a0",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-04",
      "group_size": 18,
      "text": "But they cried out"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "titus-khanmeti-gospels/john#John.21.7",
      "source_sha256": "39009e1de599e7f4",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-04",
      "group_size": 18,
      "text": "of fish. That disciple whom Jesus loved said to Peter: It is the Lord. When Simon Peter heard that it was the Lord, he put on his garment, for he was naked, and he threw himself"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "titus-khanmeti-gospels/john#John.21.8",
      "source_sha256": "ca9c637961675095",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-04",
      "group_size": 18,
      "text": "into the sea. The other disciples came in the boat, for they were not far from land, only about two hundred cubits, and they were dragging the net full of fish."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "titus-khanmeti-gospels/john#John.21.9",
      "source_sha256": "cb007960cb8bc598",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-04",
      "group_size": 18,
      "text": "When they got out onto land, they saw a charcoal fire laid there, with fish on it, and bread."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "titus-khanmeti-gospels/john#John.21.10",
      "source_sha256": "1eb7a16df4a46e3d",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-04",
      "group_size": 18,
      "text": "Jesus said to them: Bring some of the fish that you have just caught."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "titus-khanmeti-gospels/john#John.21.11",
      "source_sha256": "a800bca1d4f467ff",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-04",
      "group_size": 18,
      "text": "Simon Peter went out and dragged the net onto land, full of large fish, one hundred and fifty-three of them; and though there were so many, the net was not torn."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "titus-khanmeti-gospels/john#John.21.12",
      "source_sha256": "6beb9e4f6e5a5a92",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-04",
      "group_size": 18,
      "text": "Jesus said to them [?] and none of the disciples dared [?] you [?]"
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "titus-khanmeti-gospels/john#John.21.13",
      "source_sha256": "d9582ba7179c2787",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-04",
      "group_size": 18,
      "text": "[?] Jesus came, took the bread and gave it to them, and the fish likewise."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "titus-khanmeti-gospels/john#John.21.14",
      "source_sha256": "c780f52b2fc86cde",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-04",
      "group_size": 18,
      "text": "This was the third time that Jesus appeared to his disciples after he had risen from the dead."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "titus-khanmeti-gospels/john#John.21.15",
      "source_sha256": "d6ae823e700834a4",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-04",
      "group_size": 18,
      "text": "When they had eaten breakfast, [?] said to Simon [?]: Simon son of Jonah, do you love me more than these? He said to him: Yes, Lord, you know that I love you. Jesus said to him: Feed my lambs."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "titus-khanmeti-gospels/john#John.21.16",
      "source_sha256": "ddc5b11f33b27ae1",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-04",
      "group_size": 18,
      "text": "He said to him a second time: Simon son of Jonah, do you love me? He said to him: Yes, Lord, you know that I love you. Jesus said to him: Tend my sheep."
    },
    {
      "chunk_id": "titus-khanmeti-gospels/john#John.21.17",
      "source_sha256": "870d5b46ee0a5b3c",
      "provenance": "claude-opus-5-5/bulk-2026-10-12/2026-11-04",
      "group_size": 18,
      "text": "Jesus said to him the third time: Simon son of Jonah, do you love me?"
    }
  ]
}
